SUMMARY:Holiday Meetup Program and Social! Last event of 2026
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nJoin us for our final event of 202
 6! We'll end the year together\, just the way we started it back in Januar
 y at Spacewalk.\n\nDecember will combine both a traditional program with w
 orld-class presentations AND an amazing networking opportunity. Featured t
 alks will be announced soon - be on the lookout.\n\n**Location:**\nWe want
  to do something special\, so the venue will be The Carolina Theater in do
 wntown Durham\, NC. We'll start in Cinema One with programming\, then move
  outside to the concession area for the networking social.\n\n**Carolina T
 heater**\n[Address](https://www.google.com/search?sa=X&sca_esv=9e40641db8b
